# A control byte embedded in a test fixture string makes Git classify the whole
# source file as binary, and every later change to it lands as
# `Bin 2085 -> 3026 bytes` with nothing for a reviewer to read. TypeScript
# sources are always text, so diff them as text.
*.ts diff

# Preserve the official archive bytes, including mixed LF/CRLF schema files.
tests/conformance/schemas/strict/*.xsd -text
